---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Jembi Health Systems">
  <main class="case">
    <div class="case-hero shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">Selected Work · 2022–Present</div>
      <h1>Jembi Health Systems</h1>

      <p class="case-lead">
        Programme leadership across complex, multi donor digital health
        programmes, combining delivery, technology, financial management,
        resource planning and partnership development across Africa.
      </p>

      <div class="case-meta">
        <span>Period</span>
        <strong>2022–Present</strong>
        <span>Role</span>
        <strong>Senior Program Manager</strong>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="shell case-grid">
      <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">Programme Scale</div>
        <h2>Managing delivery across a complex digital health portfolio.</h2>

        <p>
          At Jembi Health Systems, the focus is programme leadership across
          digital health and health information systems programmes, working
          across multiple countries, funding organisations, delivery teams,
          contractors and technology partners.
        </p>

        <p>
          The portfolio brings together programme delivery, financial
          management, resource planning and stakeholder management within an
          environment where technology, implementation and donor requirements
          have to remain aligned.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="case-panel">
        <div class="eyebrow">At a glance</div>

        <div class="stat">
          <strong>5</strong>
          <span>named funding organisations</span>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
          <strong>7</strong>
          <span>African countries</span>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
          <strong>Multi donor</strong>
          <span>programme portfolio</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="shell case-grid reverse">
      <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">Automation</div>
        <h2>Turning proposal management into an operational capability.</h2>

        <p>
          Alongside programme delivery, the role has included development of
          an AI powered RFP and proposal pipeline to improve the way new
          opportunities are identified, assessed and progressed.
        </p>

        <p>
          The workflow brings together opportunity ingestion, AI
          categorisation, partner matching, bid or no bid scoring and
          automated proposal generation.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="case-panel">
        <div class="eyebrow">Operating priorities</div>

        <div class="step"><b>01</b> Programme delivery</div>
        <div class="step"><b>02</b> Financial management</div>
        <div class="step"><b>03</b> Resource planning</div>
        <div class="step"><b>04</b> Bid management</div>
        <div class="step"><b>05</b> Digital health delivery</div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="shell case-grid">
      <article>
        <div class="eyebrow">Partnership</div>
        <h2>Connecting delivery, technology and stakeholders.</h2>

        <p>
          The work requires coordination between donors, implementing
          partners, Ministries of Health, technical teams, contractors and
          technology partners.
        </p>

        <p>
          The result is a programme management role that sits between
          strategy and execution, ensuring that resources, technology,
          partnerships and delivery remain connected.
        </p>
      </article>

      <aside class="case-panel">
        <div class="eyebrow">Funding organisations</div>

        <div class="step">PEPFAR</div>
        <div class="step">USAID</div>
        <div class="step">GIZ</div>
        <div class="step">Gates Foundation</div>
        <div class="step">Patrick J. McGovern Foundation</div>
      </aside>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>